        <mxCell id="LZTYUNNshPd-Peh8ks5s-2" edge="1" parent="1" source="93WtVu3acJQ8oelPs9tj-523" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.25;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="LZTYUNNshPd-Peh8ks5s-1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="93WtVu3acJQ8oelPs9tj-523" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=default;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=default;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px; line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;主用单元&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px; line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;1、实时承担功率变换，故障后立即切旁路&lt;br&gt;2、每相至少保留一个冗余单元，在故障切出一个单元后，系统还能正常工作&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="690.47" x="-277" y="2156.4700000000003" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LZTYUNNshPd-Peh8ks5s-4" edge="1" parent="1" source="93WtVu3acJQ8oelPs9tj-524" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="93WtVu3acJQ8oelPs9tj-523">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="93WtVu3acJQ8oelPs9tj-524" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=default;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px; line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;热冗余单元&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px; line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;1、DC2DC空载运行维持母线电压，交流侧旁路，&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;LLC拓扑无反向稳压能力，不适用&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;2、DC/AC侧PWM发波，通过接触器与交流侧隔离，先确认单元合格后再投运&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;3、主控判断有模块切出后，给热冗余模块发送切入指令，快速切入&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="770" x="591" y="2156.4700000000003" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LZTYUNNshPd-Peh8ks5s-3" edge="1" parent="1" source="LZTYUNNshPd-Peh8ks5s-1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.75;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="93WtVu3acJQ8oelPs9tj-524">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LZTYUNNshPd-Peh8ks5s-1" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=default;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px; line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;冷冗余单元&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px; line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;1、只保留电源，可以休眠节能，DC2DC与DC/AC都不发PWM波，电容电压为0&lt;br&gt;2、接受主控指令，实现软启动后，发PWM波自检合格后进入热冗余状态&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="127" width="738" x="170" y="2506" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
